    ["<Highlight>非凡聚合</>：可以将两个非凡物质聚合成一个新的非凡物质。\n<Highlight>词条继承</>：非凡聚合时，聚合产物词条会<Highlight>全部</>从<Highlight>放入的非凡物质</>的词条中随机选取。\n<Highlight>词条异变</>：放入聚合的非凡物质词条总数大于等于6时，聚合后有极小概率出现异变，生成异变词条，放入聚合的非凡物质词条总数量与类型不同时，可以出现的异变词条不同。\n<Highlight>词条升级</>：放入聚合的非凡物质词条总数大于等于6时，聚合后有概率触发词条升级，部分词条的属性值提升。\n<Highlight>高级聚合</>：当前持有的4词条及以上攻击非凡物质与防御非凡物质均达到2个时，解锁4词条攻击非凡物质放入聚合；当前持有的5词条攻击非凡物质与防御非凡物质均达到2个时，解锁5词条非凡物质放入聚合。\n<Highlight>聚合熟练度</>：进行非凡物质聚合时会提升<Highlight>聚合熟练度</>，聚合熟练度赛季重置，达到一定值后可以获得奖励。"] = "<Highlight>Beyonder Aggregation</>: You can aggregate two Beyonder materials into a new Beyonder material.\n<Highlight>Trait Inheritance</>: During Beyonder Aggregation, the traits of the resulting product will be <Highlight>all</> randomly selected from the traits of the <Highlight>input Beyonder materials</>.\n<Highlight>Trait Mutation</>: When the total number of traits of the input Beyonder materials is 6 or more, there is a very small chance of mutation after aggregation, generating a mutated trait. Different mutated traits can appear depending on the total number and types of traits in the input Beyonder materials.\n<Highlight>Trait Upgrade</>: When the total number of traits of the input Beyonder materials is 6 or more, there is a chance to trigger a trait upgrade after aggregation, increasing the attribute values of some traits.\n<Highlight>Advanced Aggregation</>: When you currently possess 2 attack Beyonder materials with 4+ traits and 2 defense Beyonder materials with 4+ traits, you unlock the ability to use 4-trait Beyonder materials in aggregation; when you possess 2 attack Beyonder materials with 5 traits and 2 defense Beyonder materials with 5 traits, you unlock the ability to use 5-trait Beyonder materials in aggregation.\n<Highlight>Aggregation Proficiency</>: Performing Beyonder material aggregation will increase <Highlight>Aggregation Proficiency</>. Aggregation Proficiency resets each season, and you can obtain rewards upon reaching certain values.",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071050\" color=\"#f4a067\">皇帝的新衣</>伤害吸收量提高25%;<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071070\" color=\"#f4a067\">神秘再现</>召唤的神秘幻象每次攻击可以回复5点<HighLight>神秘知识</>;<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">信息洪流</>技能期间自身额外获得10%减伤，增益最多持续7秒"] = "The damage absorption of <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071050\" color=\"#f4a067\">The Emperor's New Clothes</> is increased by 25%. Each attack from the Mysterious Illusion summoned by <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86071070\" color=\"#f4a067\">Mystical Re-enactment</> restores 5 points of <HighLight>Secret Peeking</>. During <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86073010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Torrent of Information</>, you gain an additional 10% damage reduction, with the buff lasting up to 7 seconds.",
    ["<InvHighlight>1号子弹</>是真的。\n\n欲念使者大幅降低了<InvHighlight>真弹的比例</>，使第一次选择命中真弹的概率变得<InvHighlight>微乎其微</>。\n\n当一颗假弹被排除后，剩余选项中出现真弹的概率随之上升。因此，<InvHighlight>更换选择</>更为有利。\n\n概率只能揭示更有利的选择，并不能决定最终结果。若实际结果与判断不符，也只是<InvHighlight>运气造成的偶然</>。"] = "<InvHighlight>Bullet No. 1</> is real. \n\nThe Messenger of Desire significantly reduced the <InvHighlight>proportion of real bullets</>, making the probability of hitting a real bullet on the first choice <InvHighlight>negligible</>. \n\nWhen a fake bullet is excluded, the probability of a real bullet appearing among the remaining options rises. Therefore, <InvHighlight>changing your choice</> is more advantageous. \n\nProbability can only reveal the more advantageous choice; it cannot determine the final result. If the actual result does not match the judgment, it is merely <InvHighlight>an accident caused by luck</>.",
